# ZEUS cloud layer - environment variable NAMES ONLY.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values (never commit `.env`).
# When both are empty/missing the app runs as the single-user desktop version.
# The anon key is public by design; the real secrets (Google Client ID/Secret,
# database password, service-role key) live in the Supabase dashboard only.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=